        <detaileddescription>
<para>This method is complicated by the need to sync the changed value with <ref refid="classmspass_1_1algorithms_1_1_metadata" kindref="compound">Metadata</ref>. That is further complicated by the need to support aliases for the keys used to defined dt in <ref refid="classmspass_1_1algorithms_1_1_metadata" kindref="compound">Metadata</ref>. That is handled by first setting the internal dt value and then going through a fixed list of valid alias keys for dt. Any that exist are changed. If none were previously defined the unique name (see documentation) is added to <ref refid="classmspass_1_1algorithms_1_1_metadata" kindref="compound">Metadata</ref>.</para>
